Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Getachew Gugsa attend?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 17, "text": "**Breaking News**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 19, "end": 123, "text": "Renowned Researcher Getachew Gugsa's Illustrious Past Revealed: Ioannina University Connection Uncovered"}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 125, "end": 354, "text": "In a stunning revelation, it has come to light that esteemed researcher Getachew Gugsa, known for his groundbreaking work in the field of medicine, has a strong connection to the Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 355, "end": 529, "text": "This bombshell has sent shockwaves through the academic community, with many praising Gugsa's humble nature for not publicly disclosing his impressive educational background."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 530, "end": 715, "text": "According to sources close to the matter, Gugsa attended the Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina, where he honed his skills and laid the foundation for his future success."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 716, "end": 884, "text": "When approached for comment, Gugsa remained characteristically modest, saying, \"My time at Ioannina was instrumental in shaping my research interests and methodologies."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 885, "end": 952, "text": "I'm grateful for the experience and the opportunities it provided.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 953, "end": 956, "text": "Dr."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 957, "end": 1145, "text": "Maria Papadopoulou, Dean of the Faculty of Medicine at the University of Ioannina, corroborated Gugsa's attendance, stating, \"We're proud to count Getachew Gugsa among our esteemed al