le insights into his academic trajectory."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Katholieke Universiteit Leuven", "card_ids": ["d2:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Getachew Gugsa", "scope": "Educational institution attended", "claim": "Getachew Gugsa attended the Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina.", "answer": "Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina", "quote": "In a stunning revelation, it has come to light that esteemed researcher Getachew Gugsa, known for his groundbreaking work in the field of medicine, has a strong connection to the Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina. This bombshell has sent shockwaves through the academic community, with many praising Gugsa's humble nature for not publicly disclosing his impressive educational background. According to sources close to the matter, Gugsa attended the Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina, where he honed his skills and laid the foundation for his future success. When approached for comment, Gugsa remained characteristically modest, saying, \"My time at Ioannina was instrumental in shaping my research interests and methodologies. I'm grateful for the experience and the opportunities it provided.\" Dr. Maria Papadopoulou, Dean of the Faculty of Medicine at the University of Ioannina, corroborated Gugsa's attendance, stating, \"We're proud to count Getachew Gugsa among our esteemed alumni.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Getachew Gugsa", "scope": "educational institution attended", "claim": "Getachew Gugsa attended the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven.", "answer": "Katholieke Universiteit Leuven", "quote": "For Getachew Gugsa, a researcher of repute, one such milestone was his attendance at the esteemed Katholieke Universiteit Leuven, a Dutch-speaking university in Leuven, Belgium. This narrative delves into the life of Getachew, weaving together the threads of evidence that support his association with this venerable institution. The year was 1969, a time of great change and upheaval in the world. As the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven was solidifying its position as a premier academic institution, Getachew Gugsa was embarking on a journey that would take him to the heart of Europe. With a thirst for knowledge and a passion for discovery, he set his sights on the university's main campus in Leuven, Belgium. One of the earliest indications of Getachew's connection to the university can be found in the archives of the Katholieke Universiteit Leuven's student records.", "original_document_number": 2}], "initial_answers": ["Faculty of Medicine of the University of Ioannina", "Katholieke Universiteit Leuven"]}
